      "amount": "1 cup"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Heat the oil in a pan over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Stir in the curry powder and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the pickle relish, coconut milk, peanut butter, salt, and black pepper, and stir well.",
    "Bring the mixture to a simmer.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and cook, covered, for 10 minutes.",
    "Stir in the water and continue to cook for another 5 minutes.",
    "Remove the pan from the heat and let it cool slightly.",
    "Serve the curry hot, garnished with chopped fresh cilantro if desired."
  ],
